<title>GERMANY: Hanover Re 96 net profit rises 59.6 pct.</title>
<headline>Hanover Re 96 net profit rises 59.6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HANOVER, Germany 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calendar 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Group net profit			   108.2   vs 67.8</p>
<p>    Group premium income		     6,400   vs 5,990</p>
<p>    Dividend				     3.52    vs 3.00</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German insurer is Hannover Rueckversicherungs-AG, the world's fifth largest reinsurance group.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
